  id: tutorial_farming1
  title: Farming (1/2)
  body: 'Your farm is filled with three types of crops:


    - Fruit Trees: produces
    Fruits

    - Vegetables: produces Vegetables

    - Berry Bushes: produces Berries


    Every
    crop has five different growth stages - starting from Sprout, to Seedling, to
    Vegetative, to Budding, then finally Mature. Whenever a turn passes, every crop
    advances one stage.'
